# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — Lenny Growth Assistant
#
# Categories:
#   1. Secrets / environment files
#   2. Python runtime artefacts
#   3. Test / coverage artefacts
#   4. Node / frontend build artefacts
#   5. Database files
#   6. Vector store / embedding data
#   7. Ingestion raw / processed data
#   8. Logs
#   9. Docker local overrides
#  10. IDE / OS metadata
#
# Rules:
#   - agent-transcripts/ is NOT ignored (required deliverable; review for secrets before commit)
#   - .env.example IS committed (safe placeholders only)
#   - Source code, tests, docs, migrations, skills are always committed
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── 1. Secrets / Environment files ───────────────────────────────────────────
# NEVER commit real credentials. .env.example is the safe committed template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Misc secret files
*.pem
*.key
*.secret
secrets/


# ── 2. Python runtime artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so

# Packaging / distribution
*.egg
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
MANIFEST

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# Package manager lock files (keep poetry.lock / requirements committed;
# ignore nothing here — lock files should be tracked for reproducibility)

# Type checker caches
.mypy_cache/
.pytype/
.ruff_cache/


# ── 3. Test / coverage artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.cover
nosetests.xml
test-results/


# ── 4. Node / Frontend build artefacts ───────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/
frontend/.next/
frontend/out/
frontend/.nuxt/
frontend/.cache/
.parcel-cache/

# Vite build output
dist/
.vite/


# ── 5. Database files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore local SQLite/DB files; PostgreSQL data lives in Docker volume
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db


# ── 6. Vector store / embedding data ─────────────────────────────────────────
# These are generated artefacts rebuilt by the ingestion pipeline.
# Do NOT commit — they can be large and are fully reproducible.
chroma_db/
chroma/
qdrant_storage/
vector_store/
*.faiss
*.index
# Pickle files used for interim embedding artefacts
*.pkl


# ── 7. Ingestion raw / processed data ────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw transcript files fetched from the upstream GitHub source are not committed.
# Processed/chunked JSONL output is also excluded (regenerated by pipeline).
ingestion/raw/
ingestion/processed/


# ── 8. Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
*.log.*


# ── 9. Docker local overrides ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The base docker-compose.yml IS committed.
# Local override files are not (they may contain machine-specific paths or secrets).
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.local.yml


# ── 10. IDE / OS metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml

# VS Code
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux
*~
